hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"76","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa Umm Salamah (Allah amridhie), mke wa Nabii (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam), amesema: ((Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alipotoa salamu [kumaliza] swala yake, wanawake husimama mara tu anapomaliza salamu, na Nabii (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) hukaa mahali pake kidogo)). Ibn Shihab (Allah amrehemu) amesema: Tunaona kukaa kwake huko — na Allah anajua zaidi — [ni] ili wanawake watoke kabla ya wanaume waliomaliza swala kuwapata."
